		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elemental Munition</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Reload with elemental rounds of your chosen damage type.</em></p><p><strong>Free Action.</strong> Reload your firearms. Until their next reload, they deal your choice of Acid, Cold, Fire, or Lightning damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Attacks deal +STR damage of the same type, ignoring armor.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Firearms have +1 Ammo.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Reloads every firearm you carry, like the base activation.</em></p><p><em>[M] Add +STR damage of the chosen type (ignoring armor) to each firearm attack until the next reload.</em></p>",
